        "id": 1039624
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-31T22:01:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unless I am misunderstanding something this isn\u0027t true. Since this is the entrypoint once this process dies docker will kill all other processes via the container\u0027s cgroup. Also I can\u0027t replicate the issue. On my computer any of the signals stop the process both with direct kill and with docker kill",
      "parentUuid": "1c695985_906743b9",
